Both reviewer results are `APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS`. Addressing the two conditions inline now.

```json
{"poe":"task:update","id":"t6","description":"Produces: renderRow(rowIndex, scoreResults) that performs two distinct operations on each tile element: (a) tile.textContent = letter — sets the letter character using textContent only, never innerHTML, per MN-SEC-03; (b) tile.classList.add(result) — adds 'correct', 'present', or 'absent' CSS class to apply color state. CSS classes 'correct', 'present', 'absent' must be defined in t1 (HTML skeleton) or t9 (CSS) before this task is marked done — implementing agent must verify class definitions exist. artifactType: code. estimatedHours: 1. acceptanceCriteria: (1) Each tile displays its letter via textContent (not innerHTML); (2) Each tile receives exactly one color class matching its scoreGuess result; (3) CSS color classes are defined and applied correctly — tiles visually show green/yellow/gray; (4) MN-SEC-03 satisfied: no innerHTML assignment with user-derived content anywhere in renderRow."}
```

```json
{"poe":"task:update","id":"t11","description":"Produces: written audit report confirming pass/fail for all 16 MN identifiers enumerated in must-nots.md (note: must-nots.md overview states 14 but actually enumerates 16 — auditor must work from the full identifier list, not the stated count). Full checklist: MN-SEC-01 (no network requests), MN-SEC-02 (no external CDN resources), MN-SEC-03 (no innerHTML with user input), MN-PRIV-01 (no localStorage/sessionStorage/cookies/IndexedDB), MN-PRIV-02 (no analytics/telemetry/tracking), MN-PRIV-03 (no logging of player guesses to external endpoint or console), MN-TRUST-01 (no attempt consumed on invalid guess), MN-TRUST-02 (target word not revealed before game over), MN-TRUST-03 (target word does not change mid-game), MN-ARCH-01 (no frameworks/libraries/build tools), MN-ARCH-02 (no build step required — game opens via file://), MN-ARCH-03 (no backend server/API/server-side logic), MN-SCOPE-01 (no user accounts/auth), MN-SCOPE-02 (no daily-word mode), MN-QG-01 (zero JS errors in Chrome/Firefox/Safari/Edge), MN-QG-02 (correct duplicate-letter color coding). Verification methods per must-nots.md §1–§6. artifactType: test. estimatedHours: 2. acceptanceCriteria: All 16 MN identifiers listed above are individually verified and marked PASS; any single FAIL is a blocker before t12 can start."}
```

```json
{"poe":"done","summary":"Stage 1 plan created and approved: 3 Epics, 9 Features, 12 Tasks, 19 dependency edges. Reviewer APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS. Two conditions addressed inline: t6 updated to clarify textContent (letters) + classList (colors) as distinct operations with CSS class prerequisite noted; t11 updated to replace stated count of 14 with explicit enumeration of all 16 MN identifiers (MN-SEC-01 through MN-QG-02). Plan is ready for execution."}
```

